{"title":"Burial Wrappings","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Withered Husk, Mummy, Embalmed Priest</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"mummy\" title=\"Mummy - dropped it in 50 of 65 looted corpses (1/1.3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a272b34a0b2a37171a72.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mummy</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1–5</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"withered-husk\" title=\"Withered Husk - dropped it in 66 of 93 looted corpses (1/1.4)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/781cfb7a1f975aec8cdf.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Withered Husk</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.4<br>×1–5</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"embalmed-priest\" title=\"Embalmed Priest - dropped it in 4 of 6 looted corpses (1/1.5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/93110eebbbe23ef1adb0.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Embalmed Priest</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–7</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"burial-wrappings\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/a8f1eee73d79eed6feb5.svg\" alt=\"Burial Wrappings\"></div><h3>Burial Wrappings</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n  